From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:40:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Count Android Auto search results in SQL

Android Auto told a car how many albums a search found by counting the rows
of a full library search it kept, and kept the last count and value between
requests. A live count of the albums a search lists now tells the car, each
controller's phrase has its own count read, and nothing else is kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
